<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AP Eagers half-year net up 69.9 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AP Eagers half-year net up 69.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  2.67 vs   1.90</p>
<p>    Net profit			  2.04 vs   1.20</p>
<p>    Sales			     289.35 vs 259.38</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		  10.0 vs 8.0</p>
<p>NOTE: AP Eagers Ltd is a car dealer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
